   "id": "site-4866329a6df552e0",
   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Aquatic Plant Landscapes</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Aquatic Plant Landscapes\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original renderings: 18 Lumion renderings of the same standard waterfront scene, identical except for the aquatic plant assemblage at the water's edge, built from the paper's three viewing types, flowers (F1-F6: Canna glauca, Nelumbo nucifera, Pistia stratiotes), leaves (L1-L6: Cyperus papyrus, Arundo donax 'Versicolor', Nymphoides peltata) and flowers and leaves (FL1-FL6: Iris tectorum, Thalia dealbata, Nymphaea tetragona), each as single-species, two-species and three-species assemblages of emergent, floating-leaved and free-floating plants. Participants first answer the background section (gender, age group, education, major or profession, and whether they prefer viewing flowers or foliage) and one overall aesthetic rating of aquatic plant landscapes, then see the 18 renderings one at a time with the paper's prompt (Imagine you are physically present in the landscape shown; please rate it according to your personal perception.) and rate each on the paper's eight items from 1 = not at all to 7 = very much: landscape beauty perception (The plant landscape in the photograph is aesthetically pleasing.) and seven visual preference items, plant landscape preference, ornamental value, visual richness, vertical layering, colour, spatial arrangement and naturalness. Rebuilt from Zhang, Lai, Ye, Zhou, You & Dong (2025), Balancing Landscape and Purification in Urban Aquatic Horticulture: Selection Strategies Based on Public Perception, Horticulturae 11(9): 1044, with the renderings cropped from its Figure 3 and the items from its Table 3 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: F1-F6, L1-L6, FL1-FL6 as in its Table 2; ratings are keyed by image id with item codes LBP, PLP, APO, PLVR, PLL, PLC, PLS, PLN. Analysis as in the paper: scenic beauty estimation (SBE), with each participant's beauty ratings standardised (Z = (R - mean) / SD) and averaged per rendering, comparison of SBE by viewing type and species richness, and multiple stepwise linear regression of beauty perception on the seven visual preference items for each viewing type; the paper (320 valid online responses, snowball sampling) found flowering assemblages rated highest (F6 0.487, F3 0.480, F2 0.267) and foliage ones lowest (L5 -0.367, L1 -0.349), flowering > mixed > foliage, ornamental value the main driver for foliage landscapes and visual richness for flowering ones. Differences from the original study: (1) the wording of the background questions and of the overall aesthetic rating is ours, because the paper lists only their topics; the age groups follow the paper's reported groups (under 18, 18-25, 26-35, 36-45, 46-60) with an over-60 group added, and gender, which the paper reports but does not list among the questions, is asked as well; (2) the paper gave a short explanation of each attribute before each rating block, which it does not print, so none is shown; (3) the paper does not state the order of the renderings, so here they are shown in individually randomized order; (4) the paper's questionnaire was in Chinese on Questionnaire Star; here the English wording of its Table 3 is used and anyone can take part; (5) the renderings are the figure copies (about 1230 px wide).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"scenes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"background\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"age_group\",\n      \"title\": \"Age group\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"u18\",\n        \"text\": \"Under 18\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"18-25\",\n        \"text\": \"18-25\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"26-35\",\n        \"text\": \"26-35\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"36-45\",\n        \"text\": \"36-45\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"46-60\",\n        \"text\": \"46-60\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"60+\",\n        \"text\": \"Over 60\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"education\",\n      \"title\": \"Highest education (completed or in progress)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"highschool\",\n        \"text\": \"High school or below\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"college\",\n        \"text\": \"College degree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"graduate\",\n        \"text\": \"Graduate degree\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"occupation\",\n      \"title\": \"Your major or profession\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"viewing_preference\",\n      \"title\": \"When you look at plants, which do you prefer to view?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"flowers\",\n        \"text\": \"Flowers\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"foliage\",\n        \"text\": \"Foliage (leaves)\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"overall_aesthetic\",\n      \"title\": \"Overall, how aesthetically pleasing do you find aquatic plant landscapes?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Not at all\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very much\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"scenes\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"ratings\",\n      \"title\": \"Rating of the landscape shown\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rows\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"LBP\",\n        \"text\": \"The plant landscape in the photograph is aesthetically pleasing.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"PLP\",\n        \"text\": \"I find this plant landscape attractive.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"APO\",\n        \"text\": \"I think the plants in the picture are highly ornamental.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"PLVR\",\n        \"text\": \"The botanical landscape offers a variety of visual experiences.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"PLL\",\n        \"text\": \"The plant landscape has rich vertical layering.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"PLC\",\n        \"text\": \"The colours of the plant landscape are attractive to me.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"PLS\",\n        \"text\": \"The spatial arrangement of the planted landscape is appealing.\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"PLN\",\n        \"text\": \"This botanical landscape feels close to nature.\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 6,\n        \"text\": \"6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 7,\n        \"text\": \"7\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"1 = not at all, 7 = very much. Keyed by image id (F1-F6, L1-L6, FL1-FL6).\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"aquatic-original\">{\"source\": \"Zhang, Lai, Ye, Zhou, You & Dong (2025) Horticulturae 11: 1044\", \"n\": 320, \"prompt\": \"Imagine you are physically present in the landscape shown; please rate it according to your personal perception.\", \"scenes\": {\"F1\": \"Canna glauca\", \"F2\": \"Nelumbo nucifera\", \"F3\": \"Canna glauca + Nelumbo nucifera\", \"F4\": \"Canna glauca + Pistia stratiotes\", \"F5\": \"Nelumbo nucifera + Pistia stratiotes\", \"F6\": \"Canna glauca + Nelumbo nucifera + Pistia stratiotes\", \"L1\": \"Cyperus papyrus\", \"L2\": \"Arundo donax 'Versicolor'\", \"L3\": \"Cyperus papyrus + Arundo donax 'Versicolor'\", \"L4\": \"Cyperus papyrus + Nymphoides peltata\", \"L5\": \"Arundo donax 'Versicolor' + Nymphoides peltata\", \"L6\": \"Cyperus papyrus + Arundo donax 'Versicolor' + Nymphoides peltata\", \"FL1\": \"Iris tectorum\", \"FL2\": \"Thalia dealbata\", \"FL3\": \"Iris tectorum + Thalia dealbata\", \"FL4\": \"Iris tectorum + Nymphaea tetragona\", \"FL5\": \"Thalia dealbata + Nymphaea tetragona\", \"FL6\": \"Iris tectorum + Thalia dealbata + Nymphaea tetragona\"}, \"sbe_reported\": {\"F6\": 0.487, \"F3\": 0.48, \"F2\": 0.267, \"F1\": 0.241, \"F5\": 0.165, \"L5\": -0.367, \"L1\": -0.349, \"L2\": -0.324, \"L4\": -0.314}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#edf3f3;--card:#fff;--ink:#172224;--muted:#55666a;--accent:#21706e;--line:#d3dfe0;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#d9eeec}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 4px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.prompt{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;text-align:center}\n.scene{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--bg);padding-bottom:6px}\n.scene img{max-width:100%;max-height:42vh;width:auto;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px}\n@media (max-height:700px),(max-width:600px){.scene{position:static}}\n.it{padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.it .st{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:.96rem}\n.it .o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}\n.it label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:.9rem}\n.it label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n@media (max-width:480px){.it label input{display:none}.it label{padding:9px 0}}\n.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}\n.it.miss .o,.q.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Renderings and items: Zhang, Lai, Ye, Zhou, You &amp; Dong (2025), Horticulturae 11(9): 1044, Figure 3 and Table 3 (doi:10.3390/horticulturae11091044, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='aquatic-plant-landscape:state', IDS=[];\n  ['F','L','FL'].forEach(function(p){for(var i=1;i<=6;i++)IDS.push(p+i);});\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('aquatic-original').textContent);\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(IDS),k:0};}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Aquatic plant landscapes</h1><p>This survey is about plants growing at the edge of urban water. First come a few questions about you. Then you will see 18 pictures of the same waterside place with different water plants, and rate each picture on eight statements. It takes about 15 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='bg';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function radios(q){return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+q.name+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+(q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+q.name+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function scale7(name,lo,hi){return '<div class=\"it\" data-n=\"'+name+'\" style=\"border-top:0\"><div class=\"o\">'+[1,2,3,4,5,6,7].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+name+'\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"an\"><span>1 '+esc(lo)+'</span><span>7 '+esc(hi)+'</span></div></div>';}\n  function bg(){\n    var oa=Q.overall_aesthetic;\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+radios(Q.gender)+radios(Q.age_group)+radios(Q.education)+\n      '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"occupation\"><b>'+esc(Q.occupation.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"text\" id=\"occ\" maxlength=\"120\"></div>'+radios(Q.viewing_preference)+\n      '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"overall_aesthetic\"><b>'+esc(oa.title)+'</b>'+scale7('oa',oa.minRateDescription||'Not at all',oa.maxRateDescription||'Very much')+'</div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var v={},miss=[];['gender','age_group','education','viewing_preference'].forEach(function(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(x)v[n]=x.value;else miss.push(n);});\n      var occ=document.getElementById('occ').value.trim();if(occ)v.occupation=occ;else miss.push('occupation');\n      var o=app.querySelector('input[name=oa]:checked');if(o)v.overall_aesthetic=Number(o.value);else miss.push('overall_aesthetic');\n      app.querySelectorAll('.q').forEach(function(e){e.classList.toggle('miss',miss.indexOf(e.getAttribute('data-q'))>=0);});\n      if(miss.length){app.querySelector('.q.miss').scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please answer every question.');}\n      send(Object.keys(v).map(function(n){return SPSite.answer(n,v[n]);}),this,function(){st.step='scene';st.k=0;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function scene(){\n    if(st.k>=st.order.length){st.step='done';save();return route();}\n    var id=st.order[st.k],f=files[id],q=Q.ratings;\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Picture '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"scene\"><img alt=\"Rendered waterside landscape with aquatic plants\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"><p class=\"prompt\">'+esc(ORIG.prompt)+'</p></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\">'+(q.rows||[]).map(function(r){var nm='r__'+r.value;\n      return '<div class=\"it\" data-n=\"'+nm+'\"><div class=\"st\">'+esc(r.text)+'</div><div class=\"o\">'+[1,2,3,4,5,6,7].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+nm+'\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"an\"><span>1 Not at all</span><span>7 Very much</span></div></div>';}).join('')+'</div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.k<st.order.length-1?'Next picture':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var a={},miss=[];(q.rows||[]).forEach(function(r){var nm='r__'+r.value,x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+nm+'\"]:checked');if(x)a[r.value]=Number(x.value);else miss.push(app.querySelector('.it[data-n=\"'+nm+'\"]'));});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please rate every statement.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('ratings',a,{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.k++;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  app.addEventListener('change',function(e){var r=e.target.closest&&(e.target.closest('.it')||e.target.closest('.q'));if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');var p=r.closest('.q');if(p)p.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}});\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='bg')return bg();if(s==='scene')return scene();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','gender','age_group','education','occupation','viewing_preference','overall_aesthetic','ratings'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('scenes')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"scenes\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
